  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EEnergylandia has confirmed plans for a new hypercoaster, continuing its rapid growth into one of Europe\u0027s premier coaster destinations. The park has added a major new ride almost every year since 2014, and this latest project is expected to be its biggest yet.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
